instruction.text:
Call send_call_summary to email a summary to the clinic. Include:
- patient_name: {{patient_first_name}} {{patient_last_name}}
- provider_name: {{provider_name}}
- procedure_type: {{procedure_type}}
- screening_result: 'eligible' if patient passed screening, 'hospital_required' if they need hospital
- screening_flags: all flags from the save_screening result (e.g., diabetic_first_slot, needs_cardiac_clearance, hold_glp1_injection_1_week)
- preferred_slots: human-readable list of slot times the patient chose (e.g., 'Wednesday, May 7 at 9:00 AM')
- clinical_notes: bullet points summarizing key screening answers (BMI, blood thinner, GLP-1 medication, pacemaker, diabetic status, walker use, etc.)

Say: 'Just one moment while I send a summary to our team.' Proceed to goodbye regardless of the result.
